	"TagLine": "The villagers are dead, but they don't know it.",
	"Description": "Turns most characters into ghosts.\nAdds villagers corpses to maps.*\n\nBe warned: Mod includes deaths and suicides.\n\nRequires TMXLoader\n\n[Source: https://github.com/Platonymous/Stardew-Valley-Mods/tree/master/GhostTown\n](https://github.com/Platonymous/Stardew-Valley-Mods/tree/master/GhostTown)\n* In the current Version (1.0.0) there are 20 remnands of Villagers on the maps, some more obvious then others:\nClint, Lewis, Haley, Alex, George, Shane, Jas, Vincent, Penny, Wizard, Pierre, Gus, Caroline, Leah, Abigail, Pam, Willy, Elliot, Linus, Emily\n\nIf you do not want the villagers remains on the maps, simply delete the \"[TMX]Ghost Town\" folder that comes with the download.\n\n[YouTube](http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6_qLZx8ce7E)\n\nIf you like my mods and want to support me, you can do so via [Paypal](https://www.paypal.me/platonymousgames)   or on [Patreon](https://www.patreon.com/bePatron?u=406905) .",
